# Schema contract

- Edit Zod in `src/schema`, then `pnpm schema:export`. `schemas/` is generated (Draft 2020-12, `$id` `https://lattice.local/schemas/{name}.schema.json`).
- Discriminated unions on `type` for components (`src/schema/component.ts`). Shared fields stay on `componentBase`.
- Enums live in `src/schema/common.ts`. Bump `SCHEMA_VERSION` only for breaking bundle changes; keep `METAMODEL_ID` in sync with `src/schema/metamodel.ts`.
- `bundleSchema` is the export/import document. Integrity (FK, edge rules, cycles) is `integrityErrors` in `src/db/integrity.ts` — both must pass.
- Field paths: `components[3].lifecycle`, not generic "invalid input".
- Mentions: `{ id, label, mentionType }`. Images: http(s) only.

```ts
const result = componentSchema.safeParse(value);
if (!result.success) return { ok: false, errors: fieldPathErrors(result.error) };
```

After schema edits: `pnpm schema:export && pnpm test`.
